{"step_index":1704,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-26T13:00:55Z","input_tokens":2561,"cache_read_tokens":180777,"output_tokens":1677,"content":"We completed the verification of all three components against live disk structures, mount points, and script logic:\n\n---\n\n### Verification Results\n\n#### 1. The 6 Subvolumes in the Seed Rootfs: **VERIFIED**\nWe mounted partition 1 (`3tched-base`, UUID `6231f275-effd-4b6d-9ff7-e841531556b7`) and inspected the subvolume B-tree (`btrfs subvolume list`):\n* **ID 256**: `@` (rootfs baseline)\n* **ID 257**: `@agent_memory`\n* **ID 258**: `@agent_rules`\n* **ID 259**: `@agent_shared`\n* **ID 260**: `@agent_skills`\n* **ID 261**: `@agent_soul`\n* **ID 262**: `@agent_user`\n\nThe seed contains exactly the 7 canonical flat subvolumes without any nested or extra members.\n\n---\n\n#### 2. Upgrade Subvolume Transfer (`btrfs send / receive`): **VERIFIED**\n* **Pairing Receipt**: In `/var/lib/incus/storage-pools/3tched/.provisioning/3tchedCtlChatbot.upgrade.json`:\n  * `phase`: `\"paired\"`\n  * `host_fsid`: `7de8757c-6b8e-43d0-82fc-47e9da564775`\n  * `replica_fsid`: `46cb26f8-fc1f-4548-9238-800b6ae682cf`\n  * `direction`: `\"host-to-container\"`\n* **Boot Transfer Path** (`sync-instance-upgrade.sh`):\n  * Takes a read-only snapshot of the host upgrade tree (`btrfs subvolume snapshot -r \"$host/@\"`).\n  * Streams it via `btrfs send | btrfs receive` directly into the container's upgrade partition.\n  * Rotates the generation into `$replica/@`.\n\n---\n\n#### 3. OverlayFS Assembly: **VERIFIED**\nThe boot script (`sync-instance-upgrade.sh`) builds the composite container root:\n1. **Idmaps the lowers**:\n   * `$seed_layer` $\\leftarrow$ `$root/@` (`-o ro,X-mount.idmap=b:0:1000000:1000000000`)\n   * `$upgrade_layer` $\\leftarrow$ `$replica/@` (`-o ro,X-mount.idmap=b:0:1000000:1000000000`)\n2. **Mounts the Overlay**:\n   ```bash\n   mount -t overlay overlay -o \"ro,lowerdir=$upgrade_layer:$seed_layer\" \"$view\"\n   ```\n3. **Injects the 6 Agent Subvolumes**:\n   * Bind-mounts the 6 subvolumes from `$root/@agent_*` directly into `$view/agent/{memory,rules,shared,skills,soul,user}`.\n   * Bind-mounts `@agent_user/persist` to `$view/opt/run-mounts/persist`.\n4. **Applies to Container Rootfs**:\n   * Mounts `--rbind \"$view\" \"$container_root\"`, giving the container the exact unified view.\n\n---\n\n### Ready for Next Action\n\nAll prerequisites (seed subvolumes, btrfs send/receive pipeline, and OverlayFS wiring) are confirmed present and intact.\n\nWould you like me to proceed now with **resizing `p1` and adding the dedicated ext4 partition for Cozo** on `3tchedCtlChatbot.img`?","thinking":"The system utilizes a layered Btrfs setup with an OverlayFS root view, incorporating both seed and upgrade layers. Specifically, the mount structure reveals a read-only root-view comprised of upgrade and seed layers, and the container rootfs is located at `/var`.\n\n\nConfirmed the seed image holds the expected base structure: a root filesystem and six agent subvolumes. The upgrade process leverages Btrfs' send/receive functionality, syncing host changes to a dedicated replica partition. Finally, OverlayFS creates a read-only root view from the upgraded layer atop the seed layer, completing the layered system.\n\n\n"}
